
  Ionix Server — live medium

  Install to disk:      ionix-server-install
  List disks:           ionix-server-install disks
  Unattended installs:  ionix-server-install example > install.conf

  Wi-Fi:                iwctl
  SSH in as root:       set a password with `passwd`, or give SSH_KEY lines
                        in an answer file (see the example above)

